// Spec: docs/spec-transit-equity.html (G5 dashboard anatomy).
import "../styles/tokens.css";
---
<html lang="en" data-case="transit" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Transit Access &amp; Urban Equity</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@500;600;700&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main style="min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;gap:16px;padding:0 6vw;">
      <span style="font-family:var(--font-data);font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.14em;color:var(--accent);">CASE G · SCAFFOLDED · PIPELINE PENDING</span>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.2rem);margin:0;line-height:1.1;">Transit Access &amp; Urban Equity</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--ink-muted);max-width:36rem;margin:0;">TransJakarta, KRL, MRT and LRT on one routing graph
      with every footpath in Jabodetabek: who can reach work and a hospital within an hour on public transport —
      and who cannot. Access per kelurahan, and how unequally it is shared.</p>
